SUMMARY:Arkipelag (Eng. text)
DTSTAMP:20261125T014053Z
DTSTART:20261202T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:English subtitles\n\nIntense drama meets dark humour as Alex Sc
	hulman makes his directorial debut with Arkipelag (international title: Ad
	ult Supervision)\, starring Gustaf Skarsgård\, Fares Fares and Linus Wahlg
	ren as three fathers who accompany their daughters on a school trip to hel
	l. Stranded with a rowdy group of teenagers on an idyllic island in the St
	ockholm archipelago\, they are confronted with traumatic memories of their
	 own teenage years. Just like the youngsters\, they soon find themselves h
	aving to navigate the fine line between play and dangerous power struggles
	\, and between victim and perpetrator. Arkipelag is Sweden’s official subm
	ission for this year’s Academy Awards.\n\nMedverkande: Fares Fares\, Gusta
	f Skarsgård\, och Linus Wahlgren. Originaltitel Land Produktionsår Premiär
	 Längd Genre Åldersgräns Distributör Språk Textning Arkipelag Sverige 2026
